 "summary": {
  "ja": [
   "メッカとメディナを結ぶサウジアラビアのハラマイン高速鉄道の Talgo 350 SRO の動力車を、おもちゃの車台に載る大きさで起こした 3D モデル。白地に金と緑の線。寸法は写真と、同じ車体の AVE 102 形の模型から取った。"
  ],
  "en": [
   "3D model of the power car of the Talgo 350 SRO on Saudi Arabia's Haramain High Speed Railway between Makkah and Madinah, sized to sit on a toy chassis. White with gold and green lines. Dimensions were taken from photographs and from the AVE 102 model, which shares the body shell."
  ]
 },
